<title>SWITZERLAND: Geneva Oct prices steady vs Sept, up 0.9 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Geneva Oct prices steady vs Sept, up 0.9 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>GENEVA 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss consumer prices in the Canton of Geneva were steady in October versus the previous month and showed a 0.9 percent increase compared with the previous year, the cantonal statistics office, OCSTAT, said.</p>
<p>The overall price index was unchanged from September at 104.1 points, it said.</p>
<p>Energy prices showed a strong rise of 5.3 percent versus the previous month, and a rise of 11.1 percent year-on-year.</p>
<p>				    Oct 1996   Sept 1996   Oct 1995</p>
<p> Monthly change		 +0.0  pct  +0.1  pct   -0.3 pct</p>
<p> Yr/yr inflation		+0.9  pct  +0.6  pct   +1.7 pct</p>
<p> Index (May 1993 = 100)     104.1	104.1	 103.2</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial, +41 1 631 7340</p>
